  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changing Minds:Inclusive Governance -Increase Women&apos;s Repres in Politics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Governance and Democracy strengthened	 

Outcome 1: Increased Women&#x2019;s Representation in Politics
Outcome 2: Gender sensitive law and policy formulation is established
Outcome 3: Capacity enhanced of newly elected local councillors and young women members of political parties</narrative>
  </description>
